              "answer": "Мы",
              "hint": "You plus your friends = we.",
              "explanation": "Мы (we) is used when you include yourself in a group."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "A teacher addresses the whole class: «_____ готовы к уроку?»",
              "promptEnglish": "Are _____ ready for the lesson?",
              "options": [
                "ты",
                "мы",
                "он",
                "вы"
              ],
              "answer": "вы",
              "hint": "Addressing multiple people at once.",
              "explanation": "Вы is used when addressing multiple people."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
